I am sitting on the sofa in my flat.
It is Wednesday evening and I have finished work.
But I still need to do a small task today.
My email address in the transit portal is wrong.
It is still my old address from Mexico.
I have wanted to change that for a long time.
Normally I do such small tasks in the evening.
The laptop mostly stays shut on the table during this.
Tonight is no different.
I simply use the mobile phone.
I make myself comfortable and open the browser.
I search for the website for my tickets.
There I have to log in first.
I type in my old email address.
Then I enter my password.
The page loads for a moment.
Now my profile is on the screen.
My Mexican email address is right at the top there.
I have to finally update that now.
